invalidFix.astro:2:9 lint/nursery/noDisabledAttribute  FIXABLE  ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

  ! Avoid the native disabled attribute on this button.
  
    1 │ <!-- should generate diagnostics -->
  > 2 │ <button disabled={condition}>Save</button>
      │         ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
    3 │ <button {disabled}>Save</button>
    4 │ <button disabled={true}>Save</button>
  
  i A disabled form control can't receive keyboard focus, so it can't be reached with the Tab key.
  
  i Replace it with aria-disabled, which only exposes the disabled state to assistive technology. It does not suppress pointer or keyboard activation, form submission or validation, or apply disabled styling. Implement those behaviors, including forced-colors styling.
  
  i This rule belongs to the nursery group, which means it is not yet stable and may change in the future. Visit https://biomejs.dev/linter/#nursery for more information.
  
  i Unsafe fix: Use aria-disabled instead.
  
    2 │ <button·aria-disabled={condition}>Save</button>
      │         +++++                                  

```

